  {"i":"yh6kvn","o":"<summary>","h":"<span class=\"cs-u\"><strong>[CASE] 변론종결 후 기피신청·소송절차 정지</strong></span> <span class=\"cs-exam\">【사법16】</span>","k":"aoh2yf"},
